Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get off the babysitter。Daddy's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is an Angel doing so far from Heaven？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm no Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.51,0:03:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is hostel，yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm good at the bull，no？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marshal Ray Carter？I'm Alex Munday。I'll be your rescuer today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd find me。How many men do you have？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got two girlfriends in the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.71,0:04:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have 50 armed men.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。It hardly seems fair。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What is it？- My ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan？Dylan，we need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.27,0:05:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They got my ring。- I'm sure your wife will understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill them！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill them all！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just once，I'd like to walk out of a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get in！- You got him？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.94,0:08:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go for it！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dylan！- I'm trying！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I underestimated you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,That happens a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was three girls！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three crazy beautiful girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we have the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I always knew this day would come…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go to plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once upon a time，there were three very different little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Alex。This is the last pass。You can do it！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harder！Harder！Harder！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you！I want you now！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who grew up to be three very different women.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here it goes。Here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now they work for me。My name is Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perimeter secure。We're ready for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Agent McDowell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our first piece of mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your 10-year high-school reunion。- It'll be a fun night，Nat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Isn't that cool？- It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I still can't believe Nat and Pete are moving in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Our little Angel's growing up。- It's wild that Natalie owns property.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,The most expensive thing I own are these boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.53,0:14:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Excuse me。Those are my boots。- Whatever。My point is…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I forgot my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're broke，horny and wearing my boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you thought you could escape my fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:15:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，my God！Jason。- Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you okay？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fun。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing here？- I miss you。Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing later，after this？Later on？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jason，I thought we were on a time-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？We can't fool around at all？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Jason。I didn't think you'd make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，the photo shoot ran late。Plus，I wanted to miss all the heavy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Jason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How's the sequel going？- Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,We had，like，13 writers，so it should be pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I loved the first one。- Yeah，it was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。We got a great title for this one：Maximum Extreme-2.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.53,0:15:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,The premiere's Friday，so I brought you tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:16:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love tickets！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.71,0:16:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Be right in。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks for helping out，Jason。- Yeah，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's happening，Angels？How y'all doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Bos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.23,0:16:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look here。I see my brother ain't checked the books in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a book？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look here，lovelies，I only been here a few days，but will you explain…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…what the hell is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，what？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.87,0:16:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Careful with that，Bos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I also see y'all being played。Five G's for a Kevlar vest？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We need those。- They're made especially for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You all fine，but you crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley，come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Have a seat，Bos。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bos。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,B.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your brother didn't sweat the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.81,0:17:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We do what it takes。- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what does a Bosley do around here？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He does the most important job of all。- What's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,He connects us with Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.29,0:17:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。All right。All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good morning，Angels。- Good morning，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.71,0:17:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley，I hope the Angels aren't being too rough on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，please。I date fat women。What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great work in Mongolia，Angels…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but I'm afraid the case has taken a new turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddamn！What the f… Look… Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know where I'm watching the game at tonight。Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angels，I'd like to introduce Roger Wixon，senior director of the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Pleasure to meet you。- Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.49,0:17:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi。- Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:18:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over the years，the Townsend Agency…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.20,0:18:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…has worked on projects for the bureau…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but never one with so many innocent lives at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I'm busy watching that doggone screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good job，Bos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angels，you're aware of the Federal Witness Protection Program.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,People who testify against major crime figures…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.55,0:18:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…are relocated and given new identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The identities of these witnesses are protected by a program called HALO：
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hidden Alias List Operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The list is encrypted on two titanium rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,The data on each ring is indecipherable on its own…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.61,0:18:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but when they are read together，their codes unlock each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.87,0:18:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who wears the rings？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,The head of the U.S。Marshal Service was wearing one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ray Carter。- Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，how are you feeling？- Couple of fractured ribs，but I'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who wears the other ring？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,The head of security for the Justice Department，William Rose Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:18:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unfortunately，he was killed this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now both rings are in the open。- So the list is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone's contacted the major crime families offering to sell the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of our protected witness，Alan Caufield…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…was found dead at home in the Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angels，we need to get the HALO rings back before the list is sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We'll start at the Caufield house。- See if that leads us to HALO.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Charlie，we could really use Bosley's help on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get to drive the racecar？- Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Blow up a castle？- Not yet，Bos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what do y'all need me to do？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Read some body language。- Hell，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not going nowhere near no dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze，ladies。If you're not a dead body，other side of the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a serious situation here。My men have the area secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to ask you to evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a 211，a 183，believe it or not，we got an 11-350，and it ain't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.72,0:20:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,An 11-350？You found an illegal chinchilla ranch on the premises？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a chinchilla farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Negatory to orders to relinquish locality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Circumspect to your observation…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…we'll proceed to the interior of the dwelling with your accompaniment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I do not copy。Repeat，do not copy。I'll have to ask my sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your sergeant is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.35,0:21:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you had your game faces on at the academy，you ought to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simple cafe coronary。Freak show choked to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Questions？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Examination of soft palate reveals porcine byproduct…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…lodged in vestibule.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，let's do this。Come on，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Caufield shows no signs of trauma to the larynx.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.42,0:21:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,His struggle pattern indicates that he didn't choke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was smothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies，we got some carnauba residue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pineapple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.34,0:21:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's Sex Wax。Best for your stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pardon me？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.06,0:21:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The killer's a surfer。- How do you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,He used the credit card he uses to scrape wax off his board…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to gain entry into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thrasher scumbag surfers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.57,0:22:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found a foreign print。He was wearing reissued 1989 Air Jordans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,A limited promotional version sold…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…only at the Foot Locker in Fontana，in the summer of 2002.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.71,0:22:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a discrepancy in weight distribution…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.25,0:22:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…between the left and right sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.25,0:22:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,An anterior cruciate ligament that was repaired in the last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.13,0:22:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，who did it？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.59,0:22:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,A killer with a scar on his knee who surfs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did he stink？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.14,0:22:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a hurricane off Baja。That means good swells for south beaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was there a lot of blood？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.39,0:22:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Offshore winds，Third Point。Malibu's pumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.52,0:22:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Alex，surfboards are at your house。- Share it with me，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.57,0:22:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.45,0:22:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy？Daddy！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.16,0:22:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darling！I was meeting your mother in Bali，and they canceled the flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some sort of monsoon。So how is my favorite little ferret？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.79,0:23:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.96,0:23:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，come on。Do it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.31,0:23:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is so cute。I do the whiskers with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.89,0:23:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Munday，it is such a pleasure to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.65,0:23:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.32,0:23:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's Natalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.65,0:23:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I assure you，none of the stories are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.28,0:23:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，some of them are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.11,0:23:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you work with Alex at the hospital？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！Natalie works in the psychiatric ward…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and Dylan is the head of gynecology.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.67,0:23:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.13,0:23:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So young。- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.09,0:23:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were just on our way out。We have a major procedure coming up，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.93,0:23:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Duty calls。Sorry。- I've got to prep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.72,0:23:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scrub up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.93,0:24:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bye-bye。- Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.48,0:24:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a tiny emergency。Make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.56,0:24:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll talk later。Go save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.11,0:24:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head of gynecology？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.67,0:24:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bos？There's a waxer on your 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that you，Lord？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in there and see if he uses pineapple Sex Wax.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.55,0:24:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan，check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.52,0:24:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got sand in my ass。I can't hardly walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.31,0:24:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just blend in。Be cool，Bos.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.99,0:24:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got any wax？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.32,0:24:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great job，Bos.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:25:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that grape？It's grape.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's grape！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.62,0:25:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Suspect four eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.17,0:25:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up，Angel？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.01,0:25:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Madison Lee？- Natalie Cook？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.05,0:25:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.89,0:25:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.35,0:25:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I get the newsletter。- Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。I've heard so many stories about you。You're my favorite Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.94,0:25:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,She won the Nobel Prize for her research on flying mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.49,0:25:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,And predicted Carmine DeSoto's every move…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.87,0:25:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,by using the Cosmo Bedside Astrologer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.95,0:25:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I also set the clock on Charlie's VCR.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.96,0:25:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,And she invented the molar mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.42,0:25:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dylan and Alex？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.01,0:25:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- God，how I miss stakeouts。- I know。Aren't they the best？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.93,0:26:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring it on Bitch！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.43,0:26:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only one waxer left.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.56,0:26:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.27,0:26:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Subpatellar scar，left knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.90,0:26:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check it out。Brown shorts，red board，11 o'clock。What do you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.49,0:26:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yummy。- That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Case closed。Nat，move in。Dylan thinks he's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.49,0:26:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You always fall for the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.79,0:26:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then this guy must be really evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.83,0:26:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should see the new agency。It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.75,0:26:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe I will。Tell Charlie hello for me when you see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.51,0:26:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.58,0:27:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,There she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.62,0:27:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who do you think will be the first of us to leave？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.42,0:27:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，me or Natalie？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.46,0:27:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about？- I think it'll be Nat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.55,0:27:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？Did she say something？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.38,0:27:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nat and Pete live together now。Soon they'll be engaged…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.55,0:27:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and you and I will wear pink dresses…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.89,0:27:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,…at the wedding of Mr。and Mrs。Pete Kominsky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but even if she got married，she'd never leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sooner or later，you and I are gonna have to break in a new Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.90,0:27:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.70,0:27:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.49,0:27:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good morning，Angels。- Good morning，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.50,0:27:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.38,0:27:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.84,0:28:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.93,0:28:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，you didn't think it would be the three of us forever，did you？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.39,0:28:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I lost my nuts。Your nuts ever get small？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.73,0:28:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I get in water，they just shrink up。They become like one marble.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.91,0:28:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Killer，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.12,0:28:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just got so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.46,0:28:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,When it's big like that，I love to ride it hard and rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.00,0:28:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.46,0:28:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,The way I was getting pounded，I'm gonna be wet for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.02,0:28:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.94,0:29:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Randy Emmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.16,0:29:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Pineapple Sex Wax。- 「The Coal Bowl.」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.03,0:29:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，check it out，「Leo」，that could be his next target.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.67,0:29:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.51,0:29:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Coal Bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.93,0:29:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.44,0:29:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll buy in。- I'll find Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.19,0:29:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll look for Emmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.90,0:29:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll look for Emmers。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.12,0:29:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，Leo，you're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.33,0:29:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You in charge here？- You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.79,0:30:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I want in。- It's a two-G buy-in。Winner takes all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.76,0:30:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Rules are，there are no rules。- I'm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.88,0:30:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three out of four don't cross the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.72,0:30:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take those odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，how's it going？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.27,0:30:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Metzger's at the far double。- Is this your first time？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.69,0:30:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carmichael's at the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.03,0:30:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was thinking may…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.18,0:30:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You and Pete moving in together is a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.76,0:30:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，it's great，isn't it？- So where do you see this going？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.72,0:30:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Going？I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:31:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，say someone was to come up to me and say：
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.52,0:31:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Hey，Dylan，do you think Natalie wants to get married？」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.36,0:31:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Did Pete ask you to ask me if I wanted to get married？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.70,0:31:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Because we just moved in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.12,0:31:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heads up，I've spotted Emmers。I'm on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.53,0:31:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red bike，red helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.48,0:31:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nat，number 25。Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.27,0:31:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,The lion。That's Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.69,0:31:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got it。The guy in blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.29,0:32:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got shut out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.42,0:32:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What was that？- He's after Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.52,0:32:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,He just took out a guy in the front double.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.31,0:32:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's making his way up to Leo。- I'm gonna get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.87,0:32:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it！Let's get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got him，I got him！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.81,0:33:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's gonna crush him！- Look out，Nat！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.65,0:33:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing？！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.82,0:33:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nat，he's on your 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.33,0:33:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Natalie！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.33,0:33:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Natalie！- I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.72,0:33:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We gotta take him out！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.31,0:33:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll get back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.61,0:33:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.37,0:33:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get him at the double.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.58,0:34:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You okay？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.83,0:34:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，what are you doing with my bike？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.66,0:35:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.72,0:35:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Thin Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.11,0:36:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.24,0:36:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What the hell is going on？- Hey，you're just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.58,0:36:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm 15 and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.54,0:36:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Photos。Alan Caufield.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.41,0:36:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Max Petroni。- How'd you know my real name？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.38,0:36:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell's this？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.84,0:36:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，this is a picture of Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.05,0:36:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,The name on the back is Helen Zaas.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.85,0:36:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Helen Zaas.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.27,0:36:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name before I went into…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.10,0:36:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the Witness Protection Program 8 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.77,0:36:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then I became Dylan Sanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.07,0:36:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,When the FBI realized the young lady's potential…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.11,0:36:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…they gave me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.61,0:36:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，wait。Helen Zaas？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.62,0:36:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's your name？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.16,0:36:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Helen Zaas.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.37,0:36:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,So where does that name come from originally？Is that Ass-tralian？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.04,0:36:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.13,0:37:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God，you must have been the butt of every joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.30,0:37:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did you drive an Aston Martin？- Alex，we're being asinine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.59,0:37:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.30,0:37:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，Dylan。We're still gonna be your best butties.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.31,0:37:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，Angels，a rose by any other name still smells as sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.31,0:37:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Charlie。It's not that funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.73,0:37:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.03,0:37:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bos，can I get a ruling on this one？- You sure can.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.99,0:37:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？Personally，I'm not interested in Helen Zaas.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.49,0:37:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm more concerned about yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.41,0:37:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter what，you're still gonna be our Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.83,0:37:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you，Bos。- You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.67,0:37:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me guess，you fell for the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.21,0:37:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I fell for the worst guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.92,0:37:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he was so cute，and I liked him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.34,0:37:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,We had so much fun together…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.09,0:37:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,…just driving around，listening to metal and…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.86,0:38:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then one night，things got really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.24,0:38:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you！I would die for you，Seamus！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.29,0:38:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,O'Grady.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.42,0:38:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got some balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.38,0:38:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said he'd kill me if I told anyone，but I had to put him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Of course you did。- You did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.81,0:38:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He was my first。- Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.19,0:38:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But you told me you never did it。- My first bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.23,0:38:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Who was this guy？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.49,0:38:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Seamus O'Grady。- O'Grady？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.62,0:38:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- As in the Irish mob？- I sent him to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.63,0:39:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,O'Grady.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.34,0:39:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.39,0:39:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,O'Grady，what about your belongings？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.12,0:39:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,So if I have these，she'll find me？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.08,0:39:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The O'Gradys killed my parents。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.75,0:39:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.84,0:39:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I testified against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.13,0:39:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a second。Alan Caufield。He testified against the O'Gradys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.43,0:39:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。The O'Gradys must have HALO。This is our one lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.81,0:40:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Thin Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.06,0:40:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Our favorite assassin。- That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.98,0:40:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This needs to go get analyzed。- Yes，let's get up in there and do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.82,0:40:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.90,0:40:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I know exactly what this is。I have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.03,0:40:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The nuns gave it to us at the orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.91,0:40:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good work。- Max is in our protective custody now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.83,0:40:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's up to us to keep him safe。- Hey，I know the safest place in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.98,0:40:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，don't you worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.27,0:40:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,No O'Grady ever set foot in South Central。Can you dig it？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.52,0:40:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- This is my mama house.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.19,0:40:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rule number one：Don't look her in the eye。Understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.15,0:40:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or she'll pop。Can you dig it？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.41,0:40:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bosley。- Yes，ma'am？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.20,0:40:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.91,0:41:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.29,0:41:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What kind of trouble you in now？- I'm not in any trou… Yes，ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.96,0:41:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。- Yes，ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.56,0:41:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look at those knockers。- Boys！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.40,0:41:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mother superior will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.49,0:41:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mother，do you recognize this man？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.83,0:41:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.08,0:41:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,We called him Anthony，after St。Anthony of Padua…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.50,0:41:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,…healer of the mute。Please come forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.75,0:41:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.01,0:42:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,But his real name，like so much about him，was a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.10,0:42:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,He came to us when he was 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.94,0:42:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was found wandering in the hills，living off roots and insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.74,0:42:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,We believe his family was in a Romanian circus troupe…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.24,0:42:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,…who died in a terrible fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.07,0:42:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Although the doctors could find nothing physically wrong…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.29,0:42:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he never spoke a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.41,0:42:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And there were other idiosyncrasies。He was a painfully shy child…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.79,0:42:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,…until it came time for his monthly haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.31,0:42:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then one morning，he was simply gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.31,0:42:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Thin Man was protecting Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.19,0:42:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you're saying this man is the sole benefactor of your orphanage？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.98,0:42:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，he really is an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.99,0:43:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mother，have you had contact with him since？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.62,0:43:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，not really that much…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.75,0:43:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,…except for the odd haircut now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.50,0:43:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he does send gifts。Like this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.42,0:43:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Emmers' car。- That is a nice ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.09,0:43:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,An original 1967 numbers-matching GTO.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.69,0:43:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thorn Birds。- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.82,0:43:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bird poo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.49,0:43:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,What order did you girls say you were from again？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.16,0:43:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Larus californicus。- California gull.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.99,0:43:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fecal matter consists mostly of scaly clypeiform.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.45,0:43:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sardines that fed on large brown algae，I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.37,0:43:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's also traces of tanker fuel and storm-water runoff as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.00,0:43:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sea gulls，tankers，storm water.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.13,0:43:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,San Pedro Harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.31,0:44:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who are you？- What？！Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.74,0:44:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.20,0:44:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Jason Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.53,0:44:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,The actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.08,0:44:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you've seen Maximum Extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.83,0:44:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.50,0:44:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It was such a big movie。- What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.25,0:44:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm Alex's boyfriend。- Alex's boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.63,0:44:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Well，technically，we're on what she calls a time-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.76,0:44:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What does that mean？- Exactly。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.93,0:44:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I gotta say，you must be the world's most understanding father.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.27,0:44:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why？- All the wild stuff she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.10,0:44:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I first met Alex，I thought she was a bikini waxer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.77,0:45:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was months before I knew about Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.36,0:45:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.13,0:45:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Merkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.34,0:45:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was the name of Seamus' pit bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.76,0:45:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Armed guards。Security looks pretty tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.10,0:45:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,This dock is like a fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.85,0:45:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,ID badges。I think cargo's our best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.15,0:45:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Townsend Agency。- Bos，recon incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.07,0:45:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Got you，baby。- Yeah，check the photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.95,0:45:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.83,0:45:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Treasure Chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.71,0:45:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do a little dance。- Make a little love.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.67,0:46:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.92,0:46:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There he is，first table on the right。- Yeah，baby！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.84,0:48:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.01,0:49:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Paddy O'Malley？- Top of the morning to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.60,0:49:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，you just don't look much like any Paddy I've ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.86,0:49:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ain't never heard of no black Irish？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.90,0:49:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Black Irish？- That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.61,0:49:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who do you think invented the McRib，Lucky Charms，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.78,0:49:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shamrock Shake？That's ours。- Give me your papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.08,0:49:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Your papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.45,0:49:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.87,0:49:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you got nerve to ask me about my papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.54,0:49:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,My family suffered，man，for lack of potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.04,0:49:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Foot-and-mouth disease。Canker sores。Circumcision.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.13,0:49:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Circumcision？- Right，my wife just had a set of twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.22,0:49:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Both leprechauns。- Leprechauns？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.13,0:49:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get a whiff。Irish Spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.10,0:49:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't believe that，wipe your ass with a four-leaf clover.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.39,0:49:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,McGinty！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.60,0:49:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get this stuff on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.49,0:50:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tough，eh？- That was heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.25,0:50:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say we should take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.93,0:50:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.89,0:50:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I smell a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.64,0:51:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,This ring is pure platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.27,0:51:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,The HALO rings are titanium.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.44,0:51:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,HALO data chips should be weightless…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.69,0:51:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…surrounded by a hollow core that prevents thermal induction.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.65,0:51:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the density of the object…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.15,0:51:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is less than that of the substance in which it is immersed…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.12,0:51:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It floats.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.96,0:51:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.38,0:51:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure Helen Zaas was great，but I just can't imagine life…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.34,0:51:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,…without Dylan Sanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.85,0:51:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，let's get out of here。- Cheers to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.19,0:51:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the rush，Helen？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.28,0:52:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've only been here five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.20,0:52:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I've waited for you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.08,0:52:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Matter of fact，I've waited for you 2920 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.09,0:52:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's 417 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.38,0:52:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's 96 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.47,0:52:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.26,0:52:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enough about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.02,0:52:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about you，Helen？How have you been？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.27,0:52:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seamus.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.35,0:52:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see you still got a nice arse on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.32,0:52:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a lot of nerve stealing from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.73,0:52:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stealing back's more like it。- Give us the rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.37,0:52:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us the rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.51,0:53:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us the rings！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.94,0:53:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't lose those。We'll be taking them back in about…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.57,0:53:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,…48 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.74,0:53:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been dreaming one day I'd get to see you again…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.41,0:53:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and watch you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.99,0:53:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.79,0:53:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lights。Somebody get the lights！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.26,0:53:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seamus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.01,0:53:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seamus！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.43,0:53:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know I always like it with the light on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.82,0:54:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You don't know me anymore。- I'm the only one here who knows you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.17,0:55:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，wait，wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.46,0:55:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got to say，Helen，I've never wanted you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.46,0:55:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Always wanting what you can't have。- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.18,0:55:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll have you any way I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.36,0:56:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got the rings。Let's get out of here！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.91,0:56:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.83,0:57:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got it？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.52,0:57:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，now！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.66,0:57:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.37,0:57:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.82,0:58:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't hurt me anymore，Helen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.37,0:58:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna teach you and your friends about pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.58,0:58:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill them just so you can hear them scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.21,0:58:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.93,0:58:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got the rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.93,0:58:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you okay？- Yeah，I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.22,0:58:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.78,0:59:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.70,0:59:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hot damn it，I know who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.62,0:59:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Col。Mustard，in the dining room，with a lead pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.34,0:59:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Col。Mustard？- Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.05,0:59:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Col。Mustard？- I said，Col。Mustard…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.67,0:59:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in the dining room，with a lead pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.34,0:59:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go ahead and look in there。- Why don't you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.43,0:59:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Col。Must…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.64,0:59:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Col。Mustard？- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.18,0:59:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Col。Mustard？Col。Mustard？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.90,0:59:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Professor Plum…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.57,0:59:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in the conservatory，with a candlestick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.19,0:59:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。You got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.65,0:59:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Damn！- How the hell you know that？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.07,0:59:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,We took in one just like him a long time ago，remember？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.49,0:59:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Mama，I remember。You gave my room away.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.67,0:59:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were the cock？I was the beaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.76,0:59:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are the chances that we were both mascots？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.55,1:00:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Unbelievable。- Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.97,1:00:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like we were made for each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.31,1:00:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,The best I can figure it is，the clients contact Charlie directly.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.19,1:00:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，then he phones the girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.52,1:00:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,They show up at the place and do their thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.53,1:00:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I know，I know。At first，I didn't think I could handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.86,1:00:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The late nights，the never knowing when she'd have to go out on a job.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.24,1:00:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some of the men are pretty dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.79,1:00:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the outfits。Oh，boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.88,1:00:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be right back，Pete。It's just number one。Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.02,1:00:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.71,1:01:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna say this。Our boy Pete has no idea what he's getting into.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.09,1:01:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think he really understands the responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.26,1:01:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，no。- Pete？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.93,1:01:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The commitment。- Once they get into your house…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.85,1:01:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …you lose all spontaneity。- Gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.89,1:01:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,They do whatever they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.56,1:01:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Pete's asking her tonight？- That's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.36,1:01:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Alex is a wildcat.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.99,1:01:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，she gives as good as she gets.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.91,1:01:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alex！Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.45,1:01:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jason，Daddy。What are you doing here，Jason？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.83,1:01:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just explaining to your father here all about Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.38,1:01:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.59,1:02:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Daddy… - It's all right，Alex。I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.80,1:02:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry，Daddy，that I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.13,1:02:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd approve。I know you wanted me to be a neurosurgeon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.51,1:02:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I've discovered a whole new way to help people…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.56,1:02:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…that makes me feel so…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.98,1:02:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.65,1:02:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever makes you happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.49,1:02:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am so relieved！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.99,1:02:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just been killing me，you not knowing all these years。I…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.83,1:02:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.33,1:02:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Natalie，Dylan and I are a team.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.46,1:02:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we just took on 12 sailors.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.09,1:02:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't even imagine the positions we get ourselves into.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.39,1:02:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy，I wish you could watch us work。You'd be so proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.93,1:02:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take a shower…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.85,1:03:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…because I am covered in… Well，you can only imagine what.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.65,1:03:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then when I get back，I am gonna give you…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.98,1:03:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a full blow-by-blow.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.16,1:03:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ferret.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.51,1:03:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Natalie？- What，Pete？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.30,1:03:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've been thinking。- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.97,1:03:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- About what？- Well，look…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.52,1:03:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I know we just moved in together.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.90,1:03:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.98,1:03:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I know we agreed to take this kind of slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.74,1:03:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But… - Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.66,1:03:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's just something I gotta ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.79,1:03:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，boy。- Yeah，「Oh，boy」 is right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.91,1:04:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,So here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.50,1:04:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Twirl me first。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.77,1:04:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.27,1:04:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.32,1:05:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- About that question，Pete？- Let's talk about it later.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.79,1:06:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Here's all your stuff back.」
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.17,1:06:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up with that？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.26,1:06:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.76,1:06:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.22,1:06:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,She loved these boots.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.14,1:06:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,She doesn't want us to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.39,1:06:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute，you ladies risk your ass every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.27,1:06:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.69,1:06:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I'll never forgive myself if anything happens to you.」
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.69,1:06:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where do we go from here，Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.65,1:06:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Natalie，Alex。You need to keep your spirits up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.16,1:06:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any leads on the O'Gradys，Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.20,1:06:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any word on how Seamus broke out of prison？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.49,1:06:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,He didn't break out，Natalie。He was released.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.25,1:06:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Who would have the power to pull something like that off？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.08,1:06:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnnie Cochran.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.25,1:06:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Justice Department，the DA's office，the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.76,1:06:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,U.S。Marshal.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.84,1:06:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.18,1:07:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never gave rings to a guy before.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.60,1:07:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rings are secure，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.61,1:07:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we can all breathe a little easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.07,1:07:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well done，Angels。- Thanks，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.19,1:07:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,HALO is safe，thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.45,1:07:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's been a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.45,1:07:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope to work with you ladies again.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.49,1:07:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,But not too soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.29,1:07:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck with everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.79,1:07:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your keys.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.84,1:07:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What is it？- My ribs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.55,1:07:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,These aren't mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.27,1:07:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was a nice reach for a guy with a couple of fractured ribs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.40,1:07:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good going，Bos.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.65,1:07:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We got him。- We got who？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.94,1:08:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，he already had one ring。He just needed the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.07,1:08:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wanted to fake his own death so he wouldn't be a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.54,1:08:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who you all talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.33,1:08:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,He needed time for his plan，so he set up Seamus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.71,1:08:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then turned him loose on Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.46,1:08:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you're onto something，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.71,1:08:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！So Carter's the bad guy！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.92,1:08:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just speculation at this point，Bosley。We need proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.88,1:08:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Keys，Bosley。- Let's hit it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.72,1:08:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Punk.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.41,1:08:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Road's clear。You're good to move in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.71,1:08:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.63,1:08:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oncoming.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.06,1:09:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good job，Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.19,1:09:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can we go yet？- No，you can't，son.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.11,1:09:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta make sure it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.73,1:09:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're gonna be late。- You're not gonna be late，young ma…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.99,1:09:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You old grizzly bear！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.40,1:09:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Son，please work with me，young man.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.66,1:09:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,A few more minutes and you'll be in school。You'll never see me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.41,1:09:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，you do not mess with a black man's do！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.59,1:09:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got the phone line.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.76,1:09:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm calling from my car。Go secure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.77,1:09:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,My end of the deal's done。The Angels are off the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.27,1:09:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have the rings.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.48,1:09:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.57,1:10:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alex！Alex！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.91,1:10:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call buyer one.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.70,1:10:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alex，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.12,1:10:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nat，the handle's broken。I can't disengage.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.87,1:10:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,The deal's on。Eight o'clock，just as we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.79,1:10:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nat，plan B！- I'm calling in Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.79,1:10:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll get you out of there，Alex。Hang tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.63,1:10:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Follow the stars beyond the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.97,1:10:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take shore to hope。Stop on a stair.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.76,1:10:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,A stair？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.72,1:10:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find a man with a map.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.14,1:10:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley，can you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.81,1:10:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley，we're going to Bravo configuration immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.31,1:10:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on it。I'm on it。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.15,1:10:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，get back。We're going to Bravo configuration。Get back！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.95,1:10:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.54,1:11:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。- Okay。Come on，hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.50,1:11:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Skip。Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.43,1:11:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get on out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.84,1:11:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Get on out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.94,1:11:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Great job，Bos。- Yeah，right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.40,1:11:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carter's working with a partner。They're selling the list tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.90,1:11:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll take care of them and then find Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.36,1:11:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- See you，Bos。- Yeah，all right，all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.99,1:11:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is some bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.04,1:12:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kelly Garrett。- Hello，Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.38,1:12:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you have a case to solve？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.13,1:12:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I tried to outrun my past，but it caught up with me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.51,1:12:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I put my friends in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.68,1:12:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're in more danger now without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.73,1:12:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Natalie and Alex are gonna replace me with someone great.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.10,1:12:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,A real Angel。Not someone who's pretending to be something she's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.94,1:12:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your past is what makes you who you are，Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.82,1:12:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't forget that Charlie chose you for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.49,1:12:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angels are like diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.62,1:13:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,They can't be made。You have to find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.50,1:13:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Each one is unique.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.38,1:13:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sometimes we search too hard for answers that are right in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.04,1:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The buyers are set.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.25,1:14:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,We did it，partner！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.78,1:15:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I never really got that partner thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.46,1:15:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.80,1:15:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Madison Lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.34,1:15:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.80,1:15:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why be an Angel when I can play God？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.39,1:15:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like one of the three amigos has gone adios.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.99,1:15:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome back，Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.45,1:15:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're such a typical rebellious Pisces.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.08,1:15:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always out to prove how tough you are…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.37,1:15:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and you couldn't make it one day on your own，could you？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.50,1:15:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone reminded me that every Angel is unique.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.01,1:15:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I knew it was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.84,1:16:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who else had contacts in Mongolia…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.14,1:16:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…could hack the HALO fail-safe and hire a surfer as an assassin？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.81,1:16:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Same astrological phenom who would refer to a motocross rider…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.19,1:16:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…with a lion on his helmet as 「Leo.」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.86,1:16:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.90,1:16:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very impressive，really.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.74,1:16:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got it all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.78,1:16:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now I'm gonna really enjoy…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.16,1:16:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…knocking those halos right off your heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.75,1:16:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you're an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.58,1:16:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。You just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.59,1:16:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't take orders from a speaker box anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.72,1:16:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I work for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.14,1:16:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，your boss sucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.06,1:16:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Angels' ass-kicking pose.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.64,1:16:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seeing the three of you like that…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.65,1:16:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…does give me this little twinge of nostalgia for the old days.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.73,1:17:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,But back then，it was a little bit different.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.19,1:17:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，when I was an Angel…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.53,1:17:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,…we used guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.77,1:17:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.88,1:18:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.92,1:18:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good evening，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.26,1:18:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love the new office.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.22,1:18:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Madison，is that you？Where are the Angels？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.97,1:18:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's three more where they came from.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.72,1:18:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Madison，what have you done？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.31,1:18:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're just having a little fun。You shouldn't worry yourself，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.48,1:18:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've never had trouble…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.32,1:18:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…finding someone to give their life for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.90,1:18:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurting the Angels doesn't prove you're the best。You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.95,1:18:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do I？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.28,1:18:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Madison，you were never able to accept that this agency…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.50,1:18:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is about teamwork。We're a family。We do…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.58,1:18:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，yeah，I know。Angels forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.79,1:18:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've heard the sales pitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.18,1:18:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was very seductive…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.18,1:18:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,…once.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.01,1:18:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Madison，you deliberately went rogue on the DeSoto case…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.94,1:18:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and put your fellow Angels in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.48,1:19:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,When we finally got you out of there…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.57,1:19:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you were wounded so badly，we thought we might lose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.86,1:19:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You did lose me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.24,1:19:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，being an Angel wasn't fulfilling my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.74,1:19:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was keeping me from it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.29,1:19:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your destiny is yet to be written.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.96,1:19:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not do this，Madison.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.33,1:19:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Taking the lives of innocent people is not the answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.75,1:19:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,There must be something in you that's still good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.22,1:19:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was never good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.90,1:19:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was great.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.13,1:20:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn。What a bitch！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.79,1:20:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys，we have to outthink Madison.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.29,1:20:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter what we do，she's always two steps ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.42,1:20:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's selling the list off tonight，8：00。- But where？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.88,1:20:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nat，what else did Carter say？- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.47,1:20:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Take the stars beyond the galaxy.」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.05,1:20:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's safe to say it's on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.05,1:20:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Take shore to hope and stop on a stair.」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.48,1:21:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There's a Hope Street downtown。- But no shore for miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.85,1:21:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,A stair.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.15,1:21:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Astaire！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.86,1:21:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Astaire？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.70,1:21:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Astaire！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.16,1:21:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Possible concussion。- I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.62,1:21:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，the stars。Hollywood Walk of Fame.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.62,1:21:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beyond the Galaxy Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.50,1:21:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's Dinah Shore，Bob Hope and Fred Astaire.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.84,1:21:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nice，Nat。- Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.39,1:21:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think she's trying to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.37,1:22:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe it。We are here in Hollywood.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.96,1:22:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Angels？- I knew we were gonna do it…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.00,1:22:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shut up，damn it！- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.51,1:22:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，not you，Mama。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.22,1:22:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Have you lost your mind？- Yeah。I mean，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.72,1:22:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We gonna talk about this later.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.33,1:22:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Welcome to the Guinness World of… - Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.25,1:22:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us the map.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.25,1:23:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yahtzee！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.22,1:23:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jason！Jason！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.60,1:23:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jason！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.48,1:23:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.23,1:23:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I hear the sequel's insane。- First one was a classic.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.07,1:23:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Button your jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.28,1:24:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Button your jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.95,1:24:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The VIP gathering is on the top floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.10,1:25:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're under arrest for conspiracy to obstruct justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.22,1:25:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.03,1:26:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Kleinhardt gambit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.70,1:26:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Classic。- And apparently still effective.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.87,1:27:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,We never used to wear Kevlar till I took three in the chest.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.50,1:27:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the DeSoto case！We know！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.43,1:27:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you forgot about…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.14,1:27:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…plan B.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.69,1:27:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd recognize that arse anywhere，you piece of sh…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.37,1:27:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring it on，bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.76,1:29:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say something.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.56,1:29:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mind if I cut in？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.02,1:29:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.19,1:30:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The premiere should be a blast.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.37,1:31:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley，plan B！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.83,1:31:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's raining white women！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.26,1:31:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Plan B stands for 「plan Bosley.」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.93,1:31:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.52,1:31:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get that bitch！Get that bitch！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.48,1:31:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。They really went all out for this thing。Okay！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.78,1:32:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.45,1:32:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alex！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.41,1:33:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it。You ready？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.79,1:33:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.14,1:34:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.81,1:34:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…or be killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.23,1:34:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exciting，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.35,1:34:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.57,1:34:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to know who I am，Natalie？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.24,1:34:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you look inside your own heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.95,1:34:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Madison.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.32,1:34:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.49,1:34:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have something you'll never have.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.51,1:34:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what's that？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.18,1:34:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.54,1:35:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Enjoy heaven。- Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.41,1:36:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,She is so fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.10,1:36:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Party time.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.19,1:36:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Angels！- Bosley！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.53,1:36:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angels！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.37,1:36:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You all get that squirrel-flying lady？- Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.83,1:36:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did you scratch her？- Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.37,1:36:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You kick her？You kicked her kung fu ass？Mama，I told you！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.29,1:36:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.96,1:36:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We couldn't have done it without you。- Never！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.63,1:36:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You hear that，Mama？- I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.55,1:36:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've always known my baby boy was a genius！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.76,1:36:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why you give my room away，then，Mama？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.10,1:36:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell you why。Max？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.18,1:36:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？I'm a Bosley now！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.64,1:37:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Max Bosley！- I love Max Bosley！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.69,1:37:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Boy，you did it！- Hallelujah！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.81,1:37:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy！One second。Daddy！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.48,1:37:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darling！You made it！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.11,1:37:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just got done。Another satisfied client.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.62,1:37:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,We finished her off sooner than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.12,1:37:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Her？- It was a woman this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.95,1:37:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,We had to triple-team her，but we finally got her on her back！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.96,1:37:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.25,1:37:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.43,1:37:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jason！- Alex。You made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.10,1:37:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no！I know。We're on a time-out，I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.81,1:37:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time-out's over，baby。We're back in the game！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.69,1:37:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ferret.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.46,1:38:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you wanted to wait and everything，but…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.05,1:38:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You really look beautiful。- Thanks，Pete.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.97,1:38:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to ask you this for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.55,1:38:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,So here goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.89,1:38:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pete.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.57,1:38:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Spike？- Yeah。A puppy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.66,1:38:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,A puppy？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.74,1:38:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is that okay？I know it's a big step。- Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.08,1:38:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I already got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.71,1:38:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You did？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.21,1:38:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan！Dylan！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.76,1:38:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guess what.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.55,1:38:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pete and I have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.59,1:38:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- We're gonna get…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.10,1:39:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're gonna get what？- A puppy！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.85,1:39:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A puppy！That's great！- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.48,1:39:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I already got him。- You did.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.48,1:39:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Awesome！- His name is Spike！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.11,1:39:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So you're not leaving？- No！Of course，you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.61,1:39:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I get to kick butt with my two best friends。You think I'd give that up？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.82,1:39:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.12,1:39:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about you，Dylan？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.66,1:39:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,With O'Grady out，you can go back to your old life.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.37,1:39:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you kidding？This is my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.58,1:39:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What about you，neurosurgeon？- It's a no-brainer！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.50,1:39:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love our family！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.15,1:39:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,God！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.11,1:40:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I know we agreed to take things slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.99,1:40:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah？- But…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.83,1:40:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You… - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.13,1:40:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's an ember in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.81,1:40:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should get this to the lab and analyze it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.27,1:40:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，just crawl right up in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.35,1:40:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.62,1:40:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like the patch.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.95,1:40:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see your patch.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.09,1:40:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.30,1:41:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this Natalie？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.88,1:41:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.56,1:41:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on fire！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.57,1:41:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look around.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.32,1:41:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over your right shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.07,1:41:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is somebody coming up behind me？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.73,1:46:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am getting pelted.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.23,1:46:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pelted by the…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.19,1:46:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I literally… - I have it in…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:26.70,Title,0,0,0,0,,《霹雳娇娃2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:41.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北蒙古）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,打发保姆，爸爸回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么天使要远离天堂？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那种天使
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.51,0:03:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是民宿，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很会骑公牛，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:43.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雷·卡特，美国执法官）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷·卡特执法官，我是艾丽斯·蒙戴 今天我是来救你的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们找不到我了 你们一共派几个人过来？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的两个姐妹淘在酒吧里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.71,0:04:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有五十个大男人戴着枪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，人生本来就不公平，来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 我的肋骨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛伦，我们得离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在处理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.27,0:05:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们拿走我的戒指 - 我相信你太太会谅解的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉她！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一次就好，我想走着离开酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上去 - 你扶好他了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛伦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.94,0:08:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黛伦 - 我在快了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我低估了你们的能耐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,常有人那么说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个不要命的漂亮女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把人带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道会有今天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们按B计划行动
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前 有三个与众不同的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:11.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（娜塔丽）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:24.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（艾丽斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，艾丽斯，这是最后一次 你可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:41.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黛伦）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要单挑你，放马过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,长大后变成三个与众不同的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去拿热水
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她们为我工作，我是查理
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:48.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（威廉·罗斯·贝利，司法部）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,全区封锁，准备起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好，麦唐威探员
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的第一封信
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的十周年高中同学会 - 一定会很好玩的，小娜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那真的很酷吧？ - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不敢相信 小娜跟彼特居然住到一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的小娇娃长大了 - 这太扯了，娜塔丽有车子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最值钱的财产是这双靴子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.53,0:14:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起，那是我的靴子 - 随便，我的重点是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了重点是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你破产、色欲薰心、穿着我的靴子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你能逃出我的堡垒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别高兴得太早
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:15:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊，杰森 - 大惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真的很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好玩，对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来这里做什么？ - 我很想你，听着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里弄好后，你要做什么？ 我是说晚一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森，我们说好要冷静一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我们连玩玩都不行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森，我以为你不会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，拍照活动拖蛮久的 而且我想逃避帮忙搬重物的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 续集拍得如何？ - 很顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找来13位编剧 应该会很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢第一部 - 对，真的很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:52.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，这一部的片名取好了 《极限2》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.53,0:15:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,首映典礼在星期五 我帮你们准备好门票了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:16:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢门票
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.71,0:16:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上到 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你来帮忙，杰森 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:17.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（查尔斯·汤森私家侦探社）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,波西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？娇娃们，你们还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.23,0:16:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我发现我兄弟有阵子没对帐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有帐本吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，美女们，我才来上班几天 你们能解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.87,0:16:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点，老波
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还发现你们被骗了 防弹背心要五千块？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们需要那个 - 那是专门为我们订做的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你们很漂亮，但你们疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,波西，过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐吧，老波 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老波 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,波
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你兄弟没跟你解释清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.81,0:17:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得做该做的事 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里波西该做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他做最重要的工作 - 什么工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮我们跟查理联络
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.29,0:17:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安，娇娃们 - 早安，查理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.71,0:17:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,波西，希望娇娃们没有为难你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟，拜托，我跟胖女人交往 你在胡说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙古的任务很成功，娇娃们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕案子有新发展
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，搞什么？快点看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道今晚该去哪里看球赛 看看那玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇娃们，我要跟你们介绍 罗杰·威克森，联邦调查局资深主任
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸会 - 非常荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.49,0:17:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 哈喽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:18:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来汤森侦探社
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.20,0:18:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为联邦调查局执行计划
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但内容不曾涉及众多无辜性命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正忙着看超大屏幕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好，老波
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇娃们，你们都知道 联邦证人保护计划
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,作证指控重大罪犯的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.55,0:18:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须搬家，以新身分过生活
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些证人的身分受到幻影计划保护
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,机密化名清单行动的昵称
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,清单经过加密 存放在两枚钦制戒指里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,每枚戒指的资料无法独自加以解读
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.61,0:18:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要将两份资料放在一起 它们会各自为彼此解密
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.87,0:18:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指在谁手上？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枚由美国执法局局长保护
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雷·卡特 - 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？ - 肋骨断了几根，我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一枚戒指在手上？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,司法部安全单位负责人 威廉·罗斯·贝利
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:18:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是今天早上他遇害身亡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在两枚戒指下落不明 - 名单已经外流
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟大型黑道组织兜售清单
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:05.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安东尼奥尼黑帮家族）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:06.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迪亚伯洛集团）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.60,0:19:07.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（田中组）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.81,0:19:08.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欧葛莱帝帮）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名受保护证人，亚伦·考菲德
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,被发现陈尸在谷区家中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇娃们，我们得在清单被卖掉前 将幻影戒指找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得在考菲德家找起 - 说不定那能带我们找到幻影戒指
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理，这次我们真的需要波西帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以开赛车？ - 今天不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 炸掉城堡？ - 还不行，老波
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 解读身体语言 - 该死，太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:52.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜证专家）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:55.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（犯罪现场摄影师）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:20:01.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（犯罪现场鉴识小组主管）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.49,0:20:04.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（法医）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不要碰尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动，美女们，不是尸体的人 请站在管制区外
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情大条了，我的人已经封锁全区
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得请你们立刻撤离
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有211、183状况 还有11350，大事真的不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.72,0:20:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,11350，你们在附近 发现非法龙猫牧场？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是龙猫农场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地警方拒绝交出管辖权
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的严密监视下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们愿意接受你的陪同 到屋里搜证
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不接受，重复 我不接受，我得请示我的长官
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的长官就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.35,0:21:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在警校时用功一点 你应该知道这是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通的冠状动脉问题 这家伙是噎死的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查过软上颔后发现猪肉副产品
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡在喉咙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，就这么办，来吧，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,考菲德的喉咙没有受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.42,0:21:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,打斗模式证明他不是噎死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是被闷死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们，我们发现巴西棕搁残余物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,菠萝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.34,0:21:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,防滑板，可以让你顺一点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.06,0:21:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凶手是冲浪手 - 你怎么知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用刮掉冲浪板蜡的信用卡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,撬开门闯进屋里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,天杀的冲浪手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.57,0:22:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现陌生脚印 他穿再版1989年飞人乔丹鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,限量宣传版
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有2002年夏天 在芳塔纳的球鞋专卖店有出售
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.71,0:22:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,左右两边
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.25,0:22:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,重心分布不平均
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.25,0:22:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年修复过后十字韧带
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.13,0:22:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，这是谁干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.59,0:22:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手是膝盖有伤疤的冲浪手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很臭吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.14,0:22:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴哈外海有飓风来袭 那代表南部海滩应该有大浪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多血吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.39,0:22:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,外海三级风，马里布是好地点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.52,0:22:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾丽斯，冲浪板在你家 - 快告诉我，娇娃们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.57,0:22:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.45,0:22:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.16,0:22:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，我本来要到巴厘岛找你妈 结果班机被取消了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是季风雨的关系 我最心爱的小宝贝还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.79,0:23:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,装一下鬼脸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.96,0:23:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，来吧，好好做一次
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.31,0:23:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真的好可爱 我也会装鬼脸给我爸看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.89,0:23:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙戴先生，很荣幸终于见到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.65,0:23:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是黛伦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.32,0:23:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是娜塔丽
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.65,0:23:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你保证那些故事都不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.28,0:23:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.11,0:23:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们跟艾丽斯是医院同事？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，娜塔丽在精神科病房工作
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛伦是妇产科负责人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.67,0:23:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.13,0:23:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是青年才俊 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.09,0:23:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正要出门 等一下要动一个重大手术，所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.93,0:23:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有责任在身，抱歉 - 我得去做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.72,0:23:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去消毒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.93,0:24:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.48,0:24:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小事一桩，你在家里等我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.56,0:24:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会再聊，我得去救人一命
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.11,0:24:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,妇产科负责人？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.67,0:24:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波？ 你的六点钟方向有个涂蜡手？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是您在说话吗？上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看他是否用菠萝防滑蜡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.55,0:24:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛伦，看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.52,0:24:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙子卡在我的屁股里 我根本走不动
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.31,0:24:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快混过去，装做酷一点，老波
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.99,0:24:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有蜡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.32,0:24:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好，老波
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:25:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是葡萄口味吗？是葡萄口味
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是葡萄口味
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.62,0:25:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,排除四号嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.17,0:25:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吧？娇娃
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.01,0:25:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦迪逊·李 - 娜塔丽·库克
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.05,0:25:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.89,0:25:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.35,0:25:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有订通讯报 - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说很多你的伟大故事 你是我最喜欢的娇娃
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.94,0:25:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她研究飞行哺乳动物 得到诺贝尔奖
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.49,0:25:37.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,利用《Cosmo》床边占星专栏
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.87,0:25:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,预测卡曼迪索托的一举一动
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.95,0:25:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还帮查理设定录像机的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.96,0:25:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她发明了迫击炮牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.42,0:25:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黛伦与艾丽斯？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.01,0:25:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊，我超怀念监视行动的 - 我知道，它们是最棒的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.93,0:26:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来，混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.43,0:26:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下一名涂蜡手
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.56,0:26:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.27,0:26:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,髌下伤疤，左膝
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.90,0:26:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一下，棕短裤，红色冲浪板 11点钟方向，你觉得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.49,0:26:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很可口 - 我也那么想
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,破案了，小娜，展开行动 黛伦觉得他很帅
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.49,0:26:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老是爱上坏男人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.79,0:26:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙应该是超邪恶的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.83,0:26:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该到新办公室看看，真的很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.75,0:26:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我会的 见到查理时，帮我跟他问好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.51,0:26:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.58,0:27:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.62,0:27:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们之中谁会先离开？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.42,0:27:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你、我或娜塔丽？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.46,0:27:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在胡说什么？ - 我想一定是小娜
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.55,0:27:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？她说了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.38,0:27:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜跟彼特住在一起 很快他们会订婚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.55,0:27:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我得穿上粉红色伴娘服
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.89,0:27:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加彼特·康明斯基夫妇的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，可是就算她结婚了 她也不会离开我们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早你和我得跟新娇娃搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.90,0:27:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安，娇娃们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.70,0:27:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安，查理
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.49,0:27:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安，娇娃们 - 早安，查理
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.50,0:27:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安，娇娃们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.38,0:27:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安，查理
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.84,0:28:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安，查理
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.93,0:28:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该不会以为 我们三个会永远搭档下去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.39,0:28:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我摸不到我的蛋蛋 你的蛋蛋会变小吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.73,0:28:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一下水，蛋蛋就会缩小 变得跟弹珠差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.91,0:28:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很讨厌吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.12,0:28:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的好兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.46,0:28:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它那么大时，我喜欢来点猛的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.00,0:28:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.46,0:28:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老是被泡，得在水里待个几小时
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.02,0:28:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.94,0:29:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪·艾莫斯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.16,0:29:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 菠萝防滑蜡 - “煤坑赛道”
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.03,0:29:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧，“李欧” 那应该是他的下一个目标
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.67,0:29:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去瞧瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.51,0:29:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,煤坑赛道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.93,0:29:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该大玩一场
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.44,0:29:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去报名 - 我找李欧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.19,0:29:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找艾莫斯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.90,0:29:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去找艾莫斯 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.12,0:29:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，李欧，你是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.33,0:29:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是负责人？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.79,0:30:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要报名 - 报名费两千块，赢家通杀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.76,0:30:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 规则是没有规则 - 我接受
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.88,0:30:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,四分之三的人到不了终点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.72,0:30:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.27,0:30:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅兹杰在对面的双环区 - 这是你第一次…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.69,0:30:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡麦克在终点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.03,0:30:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想或…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.18,0:30:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟彼特住在一起是很重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.76,0:30:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对，那真的很棒吧？ - 你觉得未来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.72,0:30:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来？我不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:31:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，假设有人跑来跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.52,0:31:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,“黛伦，你觉得娜塔丽想结婚吗？”
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.36,0:31:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？彼特要你来问我 我想不想结婚吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.70,0:31:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我们才刚刚住在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.12,0:31:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，我看到艾莫斯了 我要去盯他
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.53,0:31:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色摩托车，红色安全帽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.48,0:31:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜，25号，看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.27,0:31:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,狮子，他就是李欧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.69,0:31:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了，穿蓝衣的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.29,0:32:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被挡开了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.42,0:32:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是怎么一回事？ - 他在追杀李欧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.52,0:32:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在前双环区撂倒一个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.31,0:32:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要去追李欧 - 我得去追他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.87,0:32:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了，轮到我们上场
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.81,0:33:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要撞倒他 - 小心，小娜
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.65,0:33:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.82,0:33:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜，他在你的六点钟方向
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.33,0:33:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，娜塔丽
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.33,0:33:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 娜塔丽 - 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.72,0:33:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把他解决掉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.31,0:33:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会立刻跟上去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.61,0:33:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.37,0:33:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在双环区解决他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.58,0:34:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.83,0:34:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛抢我的摩托车？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.66,0:35:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛伦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.72,0:35:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘦皮猴
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.11,0:36:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.24,0:36:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底发生了什么事？ - 你只是一个小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.58,0:36:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我15岁半了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.54,0:36:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片，亚伦·考菲德
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.41,0:36:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦斯·佩托尼 - 你怎么知道我的真名？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.38,0:36:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么一回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.84,0:36:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是黛伦的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.05,0:36:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面写着“海伦·萨斯”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.85,0:36:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦·萨斯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.27,0:36:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的真名，直到…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.10,0:36:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,八年前我加入证人保护计划
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.77,0:36:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我成为黛伦·桑德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.07,0:36:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局发现这个女孩有潜力
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.11,0:36:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打电话给我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.61,0:36:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧，等一下，海伦·萨斯？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.62,0:36:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你的本名？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.16,0:36:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦·萨斯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.37,0:36:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是哪门子的鬼名字？ 你祖辈是“澳洲屁民”吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.04,0:36:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.13,0:37:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊，你一定常被取笑
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.30,0:37:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以前开“小屁车”吗？ - 艾丽斯，我们在说什么“屁话”？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.59,0:37:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.30,0:37:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，黛伦 我们永远都会是你最好的“跟屁虫”
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.31,0:37:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，娇娃 玫瑰不论叫什么名字都一样芳香
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.31,0:37:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，查理，那一点都不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.73,0:37:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.03,0:37:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老波，能请你评评理吗？ - 当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.99,0:37:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？ 我个人对海伦·萨斯没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.49,0:37:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比较关心你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.41,0:37:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论如何，你都是我们的黛伦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.83,0:37:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你，老波 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.67,0:37:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜，你爱上坏男人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.21,0:37:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱上超级大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.92,0:37:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他真的好可爱，我非常喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.34,0:37:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.09,0:37:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车兜风，听重金属音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.22,0:37:52.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（八年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.86,0:38:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,某晚一切都变了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.24,0:38:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 我愿意为你而死，西慕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.29,0:38:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧葛莱帝
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.42,0:38:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很有种
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.38,0:38:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我要是敢说出去，他就会杀了我 但我必须检举他
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然你得那么做 - 你做了正确决定
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.81,0:38:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是我的第一次 - 真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.19,0:38:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你跟我说你从没做过 - 我第一次抓人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.23,0:38:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 这家伙到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.49,0:38:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 西慕斯·欧葛莱帝 - 欧葛莱帝？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.62,0:38:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个爱尔兰黑帮份子？ - 我送他去坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.96,0:39:00.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现在）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.63,0:39:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧葛莱帝
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.34,0:39:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以出狱了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.76,0:39:14.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（只有上帝能审判我）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.39,0:39:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧葛莱帝，你的东西呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.12,0:39:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我拿到这些，她会来找我？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.08,0:39:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧葛莱帝帮杀了我爸妈 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.75,0:39:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，麦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.84,0:39:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我作证指控他们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.13,0:39:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，亚伦·考菲德 他作证指控欧葛莱帝帮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.43,0:39:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了，欧葛莱帝帮一定拿到 幻影清单了，这是我们唯一的线索
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.81,0:40:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘦皮猴
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.06,0:40:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们最爱的杀手 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.98,0:40:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这需要加以分析 - 对，我们得送到实验室做分析
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.82,0:40:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.90,0:40:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我知道它是什么，我也有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.03,0:40:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤儿院的修女给我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.91,0:40:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤儿院
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做得好 - 现在我们得保护麦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.83,0:40:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须保护他的安全 - 我知道城里最安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.98,0:40:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.27,0:40:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧葛莱帝帮的人不会到中南区 你懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.52,0:40:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 这是我妈家
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.19,0:40:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一点，别看着她的眼睛，懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.15,0:40:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然她会抓狂的，你了解吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.41,0:40:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波西 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.20,0:40:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我过来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.91,0:41:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.29,0:41:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你又惹上什么麻烦了？ - 我没有惹…好的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.96,0:41:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.56,0:41:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看那些门环 - 孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.40,0:41:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,院长可以见你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.49,0:41:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,院长，你认得这个人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.83,0:41:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然知道他是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.08,0:41:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以圣安东尼之名 为他取名为安东尼
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.50,0:41:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哑巴的治疗者，请前面一点
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.75,0:41:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，女孩们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.01,0:42:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的真名跟他的身分一样是个谜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.10,0:42:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他七岁时到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.94,0:42:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人发现他在山丘游荡 靠吃树根与昆虫维生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.74,0:42:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信他的家人 是罗马尼亚巡演马戏团
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.24,0:42:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死于一场大火中
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.07,0:42:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生发现他的健康没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.29,0:42:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他一句话都不说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.41,0:42:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了其他的特质 他是个非常害羞的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.79,0:42:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到有一次他的剪头时间
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.31,0:42:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有天早上他走了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.31,0:42:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘦皮猴在保护麦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.19,0:42:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这个人是孤儿院 唯一的捐款人？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.98,0:42:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，他真的是个天使
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.99,0:43:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,院长，之后你跟他有联络吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.62,0:43:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不常联络
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.75,0:43:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偶尔会来剪头发
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.50,0:43:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他会送礼物过来，譬如今天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.42,0:43:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾莫斯的车 - 这辆车很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.09,0:43:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,1967年份的同名车牌跑车
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.69,0:43:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刺鸟 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.82,0:43:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟屎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.49,0:43:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说你们来自哪个教会？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.16,0:43:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加州海鸥 - 加州海鸥
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.99,0:43:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,粪便主要成份是罕见圆盾物质
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.45,0:43:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信沙丁鱼吃大量棕藻
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.37,0:43:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有坦克油料残余物 跟暴风雨洪水
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.00,0:43:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,海鸥、坦克、暴风雨
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.13,0:43:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣彼得港
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.31,0:44:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？ - 什么？等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.74,0:44:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.20,0:44:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森·吉邦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.53,0:44:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是演员
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.08,0:44:29.66,Title,0,0,0,0,,或许你看过《极限》
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.83,0:44:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看过
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.50,0:44:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是部卖座片 - 你来这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.25,0:44:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是艾丽斯的男朋友 - 艾丽斯的男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.63,0:44:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，技术上来说 我们处于她所谓的冷静期
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.76,0:44:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么意思？ - 没错，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.93,0:44:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我得说你是全世界 最了解状况的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.27,0:44:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 她做的那些疯狂事情
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.10,0:44:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚认识艾丽斯时 以为她是除毛美容师
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.77,0:45:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我知道查理几个月前的事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.36,0:45:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理又是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.90,0:45:06.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣彼得港）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.50,0:45:19.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（梅金号，都柏林）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.13,0:45:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅金号
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.34,0:45:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟西慕斯养的斗牛犬同名
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.76,0:45:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,武装警卫，戒备蛮森严的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.10,0:45:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座码头跟碉堡差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.85,0:45:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,通行证 我想货柜装了我们要找的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.15,0:45:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汤森侦探社 - 老波，侦搜资料正在传送中
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.07,0:45:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到了，宝贝 - 对，看一下照片
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.95,0:45:48.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（货柜）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.95,0:45:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们要找的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.54,0:45:53.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（藏宝箱）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.83,0:45:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏宝箱
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.71,0:45:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跳跳舞 - 放纵一下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.67,0:46:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚要玩到趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.92,0:46:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在那边，右边第一桌 - 太棒了，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.84,0:48:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.43,0:48:58.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（港务局码头部，派帝·欧迈利）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.01,0:49:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 派帝·欧迈利？ - 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.60,0:49:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长得不像我认识的欧迈利
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.86,0:49:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识爱尔兰黑人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.90,0:49:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱尔兰黑人？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.61,0:49:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为谁发明了肋排跟幸运符？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.78,0:49:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 酢浆草奶昔？那是我们的点子 - 请出示文件
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.08,0:49:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 你的文件
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.45,0:49:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.87,0:49:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我要文件
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.54,0:49:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家人因为没马铃薯吃而受苦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.04,0:49:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有口蹄疫、口腔溃疡跟割礼
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.13,0:49:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 割礼？ - 对，我太太刚生了一对双胞胎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.22,0:49:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两个都是小妖精 - 小妖精？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.13,0:49:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻一下，爱尔兰春天
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.10,0:49:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信的 拿四叶苜蓿草来擦屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.39,0:49:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦金提
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.60,0:49:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东西搬到船上
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.49,0:50:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很辛苦吧？ - 那真的是超重的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.25,0:50:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们该休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.93,0:50:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.89,0:50:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到老鼠味
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.64,0:51:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这戒指是纯铂金所制
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.27,0:51:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻影戒指是钦做的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.44,0:51:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻影资料晶片应该没重量
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.69,0:51:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,包在中空核心里，避免热能渗入
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.65,0:51:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果物质密度
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.15,0:51:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,比沉入物质的密度低
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.12,0:51:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会浮起来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.96,0:51:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.38,0:51:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信海伦·萨斯很棒 但我无法想像
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.34,0:51:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有黛伦·桑德斯的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.85,0:51:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧，我们该离开这里了 - 来为此而干一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.19,0:51:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,急什么，海伦？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.28,0:52:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才来五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.20,0:52:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.08,0:52:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我等了2920天
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.09,0:52:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等于417周
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.38,0:52:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,96个月
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.47,0:52:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,八年
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.26,0:52:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等得够久了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.02,0:52:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢，海伦？你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.27,0:52:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,西慕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.35,0:52:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你过得还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.32,0:52:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胆子大到敢偷我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.73,0:52:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该说我是来把东西拿回去 - 把戒指还给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.37,0:52:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把戒指还给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.51,0:53:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把戒指还给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.94,0:53:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把它们弄丢了 我们会把它们拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.57,0:53:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过48秒
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.74,0:53:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直梦想有一天能再见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.41,0:53:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.99,0:53:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续做梦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.79,0:53:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,开灯，快点开灯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.26,0:53:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,西慕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.01,0:53:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,西慕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.43,0:53:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我一向喜欢开灯做
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.82,0:54:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不再了解我 - 我是这里唯一了解你的人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.17,0:55:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.46,0:55:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦，我得说 我现在太想要得到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.46,0:55:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你只要你得不到的东西 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.18,0:55:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么处置你都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.36,0:56:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到戒指了，快离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.91,0:56:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让她们跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.83,0:57:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.52,0:57:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.66,0:57:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.37,0:57:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛伦，该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.82,0:58:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也无法伤害我，海伦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.37,0:58:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会教你跟你朋友痛苦的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.58,0:58:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了她们 让你听到她们的求救声
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.21,0:58:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛伦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.93,0:58:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到戒指了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.93,0:58:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.22,0:58:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.78,0:59:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是谁干的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.70,0:59:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，我知道是谁干的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.62,0:59:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,芥末上校，在餐厅，拿着铅管
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.34,0:59:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 芥末上校？ - 快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.05,0:59:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 芥末上校？ - 我说芥末上校
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.67,0:59:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在餐厅，拿着铅管
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.34,0:59:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以去看一下 - 你何不去看一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.43,0:59:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,芥末…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.64,0:59:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 芥末上校？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.18,0:59:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,芥末上校？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.90,0:59:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是梅子教授
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.57,0:59:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在温室，拿着蜡烛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.19,0:59:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，你答对了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.65,0:59:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 你怎么知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.07,0:59:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久前我们买了一个，记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.49,0:59:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，妈妈，我记得 你把我的房间清空了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.58,0:59:53.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（十周年同学会，莱戴尔高中）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.67,0:59:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是公鸡？我是水獭
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.76,0:59:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,机率太低了吧？我们都是吉祥物
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.55,1:00:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可思议 - 天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.97,1:00:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉上我们是天生一对
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.31,1:00:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我所知，客户直接联络查理
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.19,1:00:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，然后他打电话给女孩们
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.52,1:00:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们出现在指定地点 做她们的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.53,1:00:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 刚开始我也以为我会无法接受
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.86,1:00:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,深夜不归，不知道何时她得去工作
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.24,1:00:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些男人还蛮危险的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.79,1:00:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她得变装，天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.88,1:00:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来，彼特 我只是要上一号，玩得开心点
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.84,1:00:44.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（女厕，男厕）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.02,1:00:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.71,1:01:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说我们的兄弟彼特 不知道他惹上什么麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.09,1:01:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为他了解什么是责任
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.26,1:01:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 彼特？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.93,1:01:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 承诺 - 一旦它们进了你家
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.85,1:01:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会失去所有正常生活 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.89,1:01:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们爱做什么，就做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.56,1:01:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今晚彼特要问她吗？ - 他是那么说的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.36,1:01:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但艾丽斯真的很野
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.99,1:01:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说她做起事来全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.91,1:01:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽斯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.45,1:01:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森，爸 你在这里做什么，杰森？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.83,1:01:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟你爸解释查理的事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.38,1:01:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.59,1:02:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸 - 没关系，艾丽斯，我都知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.80,1:02:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸，我真的很抱歉没有早点告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.13,1:02:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你不会同意 我知道你要我当神经外科医生
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.51,1:02:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我找到全新方式来帮助别人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.56,1:02:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让我觉得…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.98,1:02:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,爽爆了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.65,1:02:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你开心就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.49,1:02:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的是大大地松了一口气
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.99,1:02:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的好难过 这些年来你一直不知情，我…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.83,1:02:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.33,1:02:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔丽、黛伦跟我是搭档
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.46,1:02:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚解决掉12名水手
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.09,1:02:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法想像我们的处境是怎样的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.39,1:02:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸，真希望你能来看我们工作 你会觉得很骄傲
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.93,1:02:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去冲个澡
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.85,1:03:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我全身都是… 你一定无法想像的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.65,1:03:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗完澡后，我要跟你…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.98,1:03:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好地吹一下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.16,1:03:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.51,1:03:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 期仔塔丽 - 什么事，彼特？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.30,1:03:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一直在想 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.97,1:03:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在想什么？ - 听着
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.52,1:03:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们才刚刚住在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.90,1:03:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吧？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.98,1:03:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们说好要慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.74,1:03:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是… - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.66,1:03:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我得问你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.79,1:03:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 对，天啊，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.91,1:04:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.50,1:04:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先让我转个圈 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.77,1:04:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.27,1:04:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.32,1:05:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要问我什么，彼特？ - 我们再找时间谈
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.78,1:05:56.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小娜与艾丽斯）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.79,1:06:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,“东西通通还给你们”
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.17,1:06:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么一回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.26,1:06:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.76,1:06:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.22,1:06:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爱这双靴子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.14,1:06:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不希望我们受伤害
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.39,1:06:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，你们每天都冒着生命危险
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.27,1:06:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.69,1:06:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,“如果你们出了事 我永远都不会原谅自己”
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.69,1:06:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办呢？查理
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.65,1:06:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔丽、艾丽斯 你们得打起精神
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.16,1:06:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有欧葛莱帝帮的消息吗？查理
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.20,1:06:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道西慕斯是怎么越狱的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.49,1:06:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有越狱，娜塔丽 他是合法出狱
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.25,1:06:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？谁有那么大的势力 可以那么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.08,1:06:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼·柯奇朗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.25,1:06:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,司法部、地检署、联邦调查局
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.76,1:06:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国执法官
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.84,1:06:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.18,1:07:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不曾把戒指交给男人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.60,1:07:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到戒指了，长官
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.61,1:07:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们可以松口气了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.07,1:07:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做得好，娇娃们 - 谢谢你，查理
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.19,1:07:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻影计划安全了，谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.45,1:07:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.45,1:07:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能再度跟你们合作
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.49,1:07:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好不要太快
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.29,1:07:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.79,1:07:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.84,1:07:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 我的肋骨
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.55,1:07:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.27,1:07:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个断了几根肋骨的家伙来说 他的身手蛮敏捷的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.40,1:07:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好，老波
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.65,1:07:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们逮到他了 - 我们逮到谁了？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.94,1:08:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，他已经有一枚戒指 他只需要另一枚戒指
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.07,1:08:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要装死，才不会变成嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.54,1:08:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底在说谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.33,1:08:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的计划需要时间 所以他把西慕斯当成棋子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.71,1:08:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,要他找黛伦报仇
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.46,1:08:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们找到线索了，娇娃们
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.71,1:08:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，原来卡特是坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.92,1:08:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只是推测 波西，我们需要证据
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.88,1:08:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 钥匙，波西 - 该出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.72,1:08:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.41,1:08:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面没人，你可以行动了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.71,1:08:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.63,1:08:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有车接近
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.06,1:09:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好，艾丽斯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.85,1:09:13.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（停）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.19,1:09:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能过去了吗？ - 不，还不行，孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.11,1:09:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得确定安全
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.73,1:09:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会迟到的 - 你不会迟到的，年轻人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.99,1:09:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个臭老头
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.40,1:09:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子，请跟我合作
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.66,1:09:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过几分钟，你们就会到学校 你们再也不会跟我见面
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.41,1:09:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊，别弄乱我的头发
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.59,1:09:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接上电话线了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.76,1:09:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打车上电话，换安全路线
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.77,1:09:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这边的工作都完成了 娇娃们已经退出这个案子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.27,1:09:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指在我手上
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.48,1:09:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛伦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.57,1:10:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽斯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.91,1:10:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,去电一号买家
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.70,1:10:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽斯，你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.12,1:10:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜，把手坏了，我无法脱离
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.87,1:10:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始交易，八点钟 跟我们说过的一样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.79,1:10:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小娜，B计划 - 我要打电话给波西
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.79,1:10:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会帮你脱身的，艾丽斯 撑着点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.63,1:10:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在银河下跟着星星走
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.97,1:10:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,登岸寻找希望，在楼梯下停住脚步
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.76,1:10:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼梯？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.72,1:10:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到有地图的人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.14,1:10:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,波西，你听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.81,1:10:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,波西，我们得立刻进行B计划
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.31,1:10:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我立刻处理，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.15,1:10:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后，我们要进行B计划
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.95,1:10:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.54,1:11:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 好了，来吧，快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.50,1:11:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快，跑起来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.43,1:11:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.84,1:11:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，快离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.94,1:11:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做得好，老波 - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.40,1:11:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特有共犯，今晚他们要卖掉清单
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.90,1:11:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得解决他们，再去找黛伦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.36,1:11:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见，老波 - 对，好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.99,1:11:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直是在胡闹
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.71,1:11:40.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（墨西哥）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.04,1:12:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯莉·嘉瑞特 - 你好，黛伦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.38,1:12:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必去办案吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.13,1:12:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我努力要摆脱过去 昨天一切又回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.51,1:12:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害我的朋友置身险境
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.68,1:12:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你不在，她们更危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.73,1:12:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔丽跟艾丽斯 会找更棒的人来取代我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.10,1:12:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个真正的娇娃 不是一心只想假装自己能做到的人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.94,1:12:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的过去造就现在的你，黛伦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.82,1:12:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了查理选择你是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.49,1:12:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇娃就跟钻石一样
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.62,1:13:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是训练不来的，你得寻找她们
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.50,1:13:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个娇娃都很独特
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.38,1:13:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我们只忙着寻找 反而看不到摊在我们眼前的答案
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.07,1:13:33.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,（《时尚COSMOPOLITAN》杂志）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.49,1:13:38.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（床边占星专栏）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.34,1:13:55.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（好莱坞）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.04,1:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,买家都到了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.25,1:14:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们办到了，伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.78,1:15:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不喜欢跟别人搭档
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.46,1:15:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇娃们，你们好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.80,1:15:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦迪逊·李
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.34,1:15:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.80,1:15:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以扮演上帝 为什么要当娇娃？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.39,1:15:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来三个好朋友少了一个
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.99,1:15:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你回来，黛伦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.45,1:15:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是典型的叛逆少女
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.08,1:15:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是要证明自己有多强
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.37,1:15:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你靠自己根本办不到，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.50,1:15:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人提醒我，每个娇娃都很独特
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.01,1:15:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道幕后主使就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.84,1:16:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁能在蒙古找到联络人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.14,1:16:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以打开幻影计划安全程序 雇用冲浪手当杀手？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.81,1:16:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道越野摩托车手 会用星座来当成代号
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.19,1:16:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的安全帽有狮子图案 代表他就是李欧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.86,1:16:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.90,1:16:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的非常厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.74,1:16:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都弄清楚了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.78,1:16:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我可以好好享受
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.16,1:16:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们无法再思考的乐趣
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.75,1:16:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是娇娃
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.58,1:16:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你不了解
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.59,1:16:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再听命扩音器传来的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.72,1:16:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为自己工作
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.14,1:16:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的老板很差劲
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.06,1:16:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇娃出击姿势
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.64,1:16:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你们三个那么做
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.65,1:16:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想起以前的日子
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.73,1:17:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但以前的做法稍有不同
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.19,1:17:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是娇娃时
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.53,1:17:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会用枪
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.77,1:17:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，查理
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.88,1:18:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈喽，娇娃们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.92,1:18:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好，查理
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.26,1:18:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢新办公室
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.22,1:18:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦迪逊，是你吗？娇娃们在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.97,1:18:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你能找到三个新娇娃
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.72,1:18:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦迪逊，你到底做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.31,1:18:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是闹着玩，别担心，查理
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.48,1:18:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都很擅长
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.32,1:18:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,找人为你卖命
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.90,1:18:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤害娇娃们无法证明你是最棒的 你很清楚那一点
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.95,1:18:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.28,1:18:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦迪逊，你一直没办法接受 这个侦探社
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.50,1:18:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求团队合作 我们是一家人，我们…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.58,1:18:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我知道，娇娃永远是娇娃
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.79,1:18:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听过那套宣传台词
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.18,1:18:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它非常有说服力
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.18,1:18:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.01,1:18:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦迪逊，你故意搞砸迪索托案
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.94,1:18:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,害你的搭档娇娃 陷入危险的处境
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.48,1:19:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于把你救出来时
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.57,1:19:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤得非常重，我们以为会失去你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.86,1:19:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的确失去了我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.24,1:19:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的，我不适合当娇娃
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.74,1:19:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那害我没办法做我想做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.29,1:19:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命运还没有决定
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.96,1:19:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做，麦迪逊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.33,1:19:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害无辜的人不是你要的答案
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.75,1:19:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定还有善良的一面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.22,1:19:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直不是好人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.90,1:19:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我非常伟大
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.13,1:20:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，真是个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.79,1:20:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，我们得跟麦迪逊斗智
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.29,1:20:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论我们怎么做 她总是能超前我们两步
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.42,1:20:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今晚八点她要卖掉清单 - 交易地点在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.88,1:20:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小娜，卡特还说了什么？ - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.47,1:20:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,“在银河下跟着星星走”
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.05,1:20:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想交易地点应该在地球上
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.05,1:20:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,“登岸寻找希望 在楼梯下停住脚步”
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.48,1:21:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 市区有一条希望街 - 但离岸边有数英里远
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.85,1:21:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼梯
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.15,1:21:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚斯坦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.86,1:21:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚斯坦？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.70,1:21:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚斯坦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.16,1:21:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能是脑震荡 - 我很担心
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.62,1:21:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位，星星，好莱坞星光大道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.62,1:21:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在银河电影院再过去一点
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.50,1:21:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有黛娜·萧、鲍勃·霍伯跟佛雷·亚斯坦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.84,1:21:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了，小娜 - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.39,1:21:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她真的要杀了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.70,1:21:57.61,Title,0,0,0,0,,（杰森·吉邦斯 《极限2》）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.37,1:22:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信 我们真的在好莱坞
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.96,1:22:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 娇娃们 - 我知道我们得这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.00,1:22:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴，该死 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.51,1:22:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说你，妈妈，对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.22,1:22:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗？ - 对，我是说不对
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.72,1:22:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们待会再谈
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.64,1:22:20.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（佛雷·亚斯坦）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.60,1:22:28.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（好莱坞吉尼斯世界纪录博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.31,1:22:31.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迪亚伯洛集团）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.03,1:22:34.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（田中组）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.41,1:22:41.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安东尼奥尼黑帮家族）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.33,1:22:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎光临吉尼斯世界… - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.25,1:22:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们地图
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.75,1:22:55.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫索与法兰克烧烤店）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.66,1:23:26.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗斯福饭店）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.25,1:23:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.22,1:23:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.60,1:23:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.48,1:23:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.23,1:23:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听说续集很疯狂 - 第一集是经典名片
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.07,1:23:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把外套扣好
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.28,1:24:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 把外套扣好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.17,1:24:14.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗斯福饭店）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.95,1:24:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,贵宾会议室在顶楼
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.98,1:25:20.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（屋顶入口）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.10,1:25:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们因为阴谋妨碍司法被捕
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.22,1:25:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.36,1:26:06.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（洛杉矶剧院）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.03,1:26:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,易容术
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.70,1:26:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太聪明了 - 还是有效
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.87,1:27:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我胸口中了三枪 我们才开始穿防弹背心
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.50,1:27:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在迪索托案，我们知道
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.43,1:27:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我，你们忘了…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.14,1:27:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,B计划
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.69,1:27:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走到哪里都认得那女人，混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.37,1:27:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来，王八蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.76,1:29:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说句话
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.56,1:29:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能插队吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.02,1:29:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.19,1:30:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,首映会应该要有爆点
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.37,1:31:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,波西，B计划
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.83,1:31:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,白人女性从天而降
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.26,1:31:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,B计划就是波西计划
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.93,1:31:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.52,1:31:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮住那个臭女人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.48,1:31:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真的很用心办活动，好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.78,1:32:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛伦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.45,1:32:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽斯
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.41,1:33:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在，你准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.79,1:33:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.14,1:34:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不杀人
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.81,1:34:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会被杀
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.23,1:34:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的很刺激，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.35,1:34:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.57,1:34:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道我是谁吗，娜塔丽？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.24,1:34:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得步扪心自问
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.95,1:34:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，麦迪逊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.32,1:34:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.49,1:34:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有你没有的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.51,1:34:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.18,1:34:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.54,1:35:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上天堂去吧 - 下地狱去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.41,1:36:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这回真的被炒了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.10,1:36:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,庆祝时间
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.19,1:36:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 娇娃们 - 波西
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.53,1:36:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇娃们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.37,1:36:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们解决掉飞天松鼠女了？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.83,1:36:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们有痛扁她吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.37,1:36:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有踢她吗？用功夫踢她？ 妈妈，我说的没错
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.29,1:36:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.96,1:36:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有你，我们是办不到的 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.63,1:36:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到了吗？妈妈 - 我听到了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.55,1:36:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都知道我儿子是天才
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.76,1:36:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要把我的房间清空？妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.10,1:36:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你为什么，麦斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.18,1:36:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？现在我是波西家的一份子
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.64,1:37:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦斯·波西 - 我爱麦斯·波西
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.69,1:37:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊，你办到了 - 哈里路亚
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.81,1:37:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸，等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.48,1:37:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.11,1:37:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚下班 又是一个非常满意的客户
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.62,1:37:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们解决掉她，比预期中还快
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.12,1:37:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她？ - 这次是女的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.95,1:37:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得三人合作对付她 但终于把她搞定了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.96,1:37:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.25,1:37:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.43,1:37:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰森 - 艾丽斯，你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.10,1:37:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我知道，我们在冷静期
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.81,1:37:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静期过去了，宝贝 我们可以继续打得火热
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.69,1:37:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.46,1:38:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想等，可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.05,1:38:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看起来真的好漂亮 - 谢谢你，彼特
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.97,1:38:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都想问你这个问题
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.55,1:38:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.89,1:38:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼特
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.57,1:38:35.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（史派克）
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.57,1:38:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史派克？ - 对，小狗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.66,1:38:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狗？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.74,1:38:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以吗？我知道这是一大步 - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.08,1:38:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把它带回家了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.71,1:38:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.21,1:38:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛伦
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.76,1:38:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.55,1:38:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼特跟我有事要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.59,1:38:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？ - 我们要…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.10,1:39:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要做什么？ - 养小狗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.85,1:39:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 养小狗，太棒了 - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.48,1:39:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经把它带回家了 - 真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.48,1:39:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 它叫史派克
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.11,1:39:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会离开？ - 当然不会，别傻了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.61,1:39:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟我的两个好朋友一起抓坏蛋 你以为我会放弃吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.82,1:39:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.12,1:39:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？黛伦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.66,1:39:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决掉欧葛莱帝后 你可以恢复以前的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.37,1:39:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗？这就是我的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.58,1:39:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢？神经外科医生 - 答案太简单了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.50,1:39:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱我们这一家
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.15,1:39:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.11,1:40:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们说好要慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.99,1:40:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以呢？ - 可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.83,1:40:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你… - 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.13,1:40:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有余烬跑到我的屁股里
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.81,1:40:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该把这个送到实验室做分析
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.27,1:40:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，爬到上面去
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.35,1:40:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.62,1:40:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个补丁
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.95,1:40:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你的补丁
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.09,1:40:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.30,1:41:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔丽在吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.88,1:41:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.56,1:41:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我着火了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.57,1:41:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一下四周
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.32,1:41:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一下右后方
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.07,1:41:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人从后面接近我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.73,1:46:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被摔了出去
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.23,1:46:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被摔了出去，因为…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.19,1:46:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真的… - 我觉得…
